# `agents.settings`

Tier list + catalog rows for the per-agent settings pane.

**Policy** — read (C0, safe). Capability `ship.agents.read`.

## Arguments

| name | type |
|------|------|
| `id` | `string` |

## Returns

`AgentSettingsResponse` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `agent` | `map` |
| `tiers` | `map` |
| `catalogs` | `map` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call agents.settings --json '{ "id": "" }'
```

Kind: read.

## Example response

```json
{
